+*   **PointModel:** A structure containing position and color data, used to define the layout for the VBO [S1, unofficial].
 
 ### Parameters
-*   `maxDepth`: Maximum recursion depth for the LOD traversal, typically 15 [S1].
-*   `_world_size`: The diagonal length of the point cloud's Axis-Aligned Bounding Box (AABB), calculated as `glm::length(pc.aabb.max() - pc.aabb.min())` [S1].
-*   `_cpuCulling`: Boolean flag to enable/disable CPU-side aggregation and frustum culling. Default: `false` [S1].
-*   `_cpuCullingEveryFrame`: Boolean flag to recompute culling every frame. Default: `false` [S1].
